flowchart LR
    Writer([Writer / User]) -->|Draft text, PDFs, prompts| Cogdoc[(Cogdoc System)]
    Cogdoc -->|Interventions, verdicts,<br/>exports, analytics| Writer
    Cogdoc -->|Embedding & chat requests| Gemini[(Google Gemini API<br/>Embeddings + LLM)]
    Gemini -->|Vectors, chat completions| Cogdoc
    Cogdoc -->|Store/read chunks + vectors| DB[(Database<br/>Postgres + pgvector)]
    DB -->|Retrieved evidence| Cogdoc
    Cogdoc -->|Auth requests| Supabase[(Supabase Auth)]
    Supabase -->|Session, user identity| Cogdoc
